---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Client Testimonials & Reviews | Shaver Realty Group – Grapevine"
  description="Read real client reviews from homeowners who sold their houses in Grapevine, Flower Mound, Colleyville and Southlake with Shaver Realty Group. Transparent pricing and clear communication."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Client Testimonials</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Real feedback from homeowners who chose a clearer, more transparent way to sell their house in Grapevine and the surrounding communities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="testimonials-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="overall">
        <div class="overall-score">4.9</div>
        <div class="overall-stars">
          <span class="star filled">★</span>
          <span class="star filled">★</span>
          <span class="star filled">★</span>
          <span class="star filled">★</span>
          <span class="star filled">★</span>
        </div>
        <p>Based on client experiences</p>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonials-grid">

        <!-- 5-star -->
        <div class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">
            “John was straightforward from day one about pricing and what to expect. We always knew where we stood, and the process felt much calmer than we anticipated. Would definitely recommend him.”
          </p>
          <div class="author">
            <strong>Sarah M.</strong> — Grapevine
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5-star -->
        <div class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">
            “The transparent commission structure was a big reason we chose John. He delivered strong marketing and stayed in close communication the entire time. No runaround, no surprises.”
          </p>
          <div class="author">
            <strong>Michael & Lisa T.</strong> — Flower Mound
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4-star -->
        <div class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star">★</span>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">
            “Very professional and easy to work with. The only reason it’s not a perfect five is that the market was a bit slower than we hoped, but John kept us informed and adjusted the strategy when needed.”
          </p>
          <div class="author">
            <strong>David R.</strong> — Colleyville
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5-star -->
        <div class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">
            “We appreciated how clear everything was — from the pricing plans to the weekly updates. Selling our home felt organized and low-stress. John knows the local market well.”
          </p>
          <div class="author">
            <strong>Jennifer K.</strong> — Southlake
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5-star -->
        <div class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">
            “Honest advice and consistent follow-through. He didn’t overpromise, and the results spoke for themselves. Glad we went with a more transparent approach.”
          </p>
          <div class="author">
            <strong>Robert H.</strong> — Grapevine
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4-star -->
        <div class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
            <span class="star">★</span>
          </div>
          <p class="quote">
            “Good experience overall. Communication was excellent and the marketing looked professional. We would work with John again.”
          </p>
          <div class="author">
            <strong>Amanda P.</strong> — Flower Mound
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="note">
        <p>These reflect real client experiences. More reviews will be added as they come in. If you’ve worked with me, I’d be grateful if you’d share your thoughts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-box">
        <h3>Ready to sell your house with a clearer experience?</h3>
        <p>Request a free home valuation or call/text anytime — happy to answer questions with no pressure.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/evaluation" class="btn btn-dark">Request Free Evaluation</a>
          <a href="tel:2147172888" class="btn">(214) 717-2888</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    padding: 4.5rem 0 3.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #111;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #555;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .testimonials-section {
    padding: 4.5rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .overall {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .overall-score {
    font-size: 3.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .overall-stars {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }

  .overall p {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .testimonial {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.9rem;
  }

  .stars {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .star {
    color: #dadce0;
  }

  .star.filled {
    color: #fbbc04;
  }

  .quote {
    color: #333;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }

  .author {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .author strong {
    color: #111;
  }

  .note {
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta-box {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    color: #111;
  }

  .cta-box p {
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    color: #111;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-dark {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-dark:hover {
    background: #333;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>